WEBVTT

00:08.341 --> 00:09.808
Legend has it...

00:10.977 --> 00:13.775
...that during the Heian Period, there
were men who fought with no weapons.

00:14.114 --> 00:19.450
They were known as the Men of
Carnage and they reigned undefeated.

00:20.921 --> 00:26.086
Their technique was called
the Mutsu Enmei Style.

00:39.206 --> 00:46.635
<i>The Age of Chaos</i>
<i>Mutsu Enmei Style Gaiden</i>

00:46.913 --> 00:52.749
<i>Rushing through my innocent</i>
<i>youth without a care in the world.</i>

00:54.287 --> 01:00.192
<i>This soul of mine is</i>
<i>so easy to influence.</i>

01:01.862 --> 01:05.628
<i>WORRY ABOUT IDENTITY</i>

01:05.732 --> 01:08.929
<i>WORRY ABOUT IDENTITY</i>

01:12.706 --> 01:19.771
<i>This is what I'm wishing</i>
<i>for as I sing this song.</i>

01:19.946 --> 01:25.782
<i>I want you to acknowledge</i>
<i>me, that's all.</i>

01:26.653 --> 01:33.923
<i>You smiled at me for</i>
<i>the very first time.</i>

01:34.094 --> 01:42.502
<i>Thank you so much, thank you</i>
<i>from the bottom of my heart.</i>

01:43.203 --> 01:44.864
<i>I'll never forget it.</i>

01:54.614 --> 01:58.050
<i>The Age of Chaos</i>
<i>Mutsu Enmei Style Gaiden</i>

01:59.352 --> 02:03.755
I'll use the Yagyu influence to
secure you a spot in the tournament...

02:04.257 --> 02:06.225
Perhaps you don't give a
damn about the tournament...

02:06.626 --> 02:09.823
But I'm sure you give
a damn about facing me!

02:14.701 --> 02:16.066
What the hell?

02:16.636 --> 02:18.536
I bet the food here is outstanding...

02:18.805 --> 02:20.272
Huh? What?

02:21.041 --> 02:25.273
She's going to stay. That's
what she means, Izu...

02:25.612 --> 02:28.410
Right. Since my
companions have arrived...

02:33.987 --> 02:37.457
<i>The Roaring Cascade</i>

02:37.457 --> 02:39.550
Please make yourselves at home.
<i>The Roaring Cascade</i>

02:40.460 --> 02:41.290
Good night.

02:56.843 --> 02:59.710
So they're giving us
a two-room guest house...

02:59.813 --> 03:02.407
Don't worry, there's
a toilet nearby, too.

03:04.284 --> 03:07.447
For some reason, their
security seems quite lax...

03:09.689 --> 03:11.623
There's nobody around nearby.

03:11.758 --> 03:14.693
It looks like they have a lot
of trust in you, Young Miss.

03:16.296 --> 03:17.854
I'm squeezing them for 1,000 ryo.

03:18.265 --> 03:21.393
I said for 1,000 ryo, I'd
destroy the Yagyu clan.

03:21.735 --> 03:24.795
Well! Those who thirst for wealth and...

03:25.171 --> 03:27.435
...power usually believe
that others are the same.

03:27.574 --> 03:30.634
Not appearing greedy is a
sure way to invite suspicion...

03:31.177 --> 03:35.614
When I demanded 1,000 ryo, he laughed
in a creepy way, that old monk...

03:36.116 --> 03:40.075
Little does he know, his thirst
for power has lured in a tiger!

03:41.087 --> 03:41.917
So...

03:42.188 --> 03:43.314
Are you really going to do it?

03:45.892 --> 03:46.756
Damn right!

03:47.093 --> 03:48.219
I'll have Iemitsu's head...

03:49.529 --> 03:50.962
...no matter what!

04:04.644 --> 04:08.671
Although we now live in a time of
peace...

04:08.782 --> 04:11.683
...we must never lose
the spirit of the warrior...

04:11.918 --> 04:14.887
...that prevailed during
Shogun Ieyasu's reign.

04:15.021 --> 04:17.148
This is extremely important.

04:17.290 --> 04:20.316
Right, right! So you agree, Nankoubou?

04:20.894 --> 04:23.624
Granted, it was Izu's idea
to hold tomorrow's tournament...

04:23.830 --> 04:26.321
...but it's something I have
long hoped would come to pass.

04:28.501 --> 04:31.265
I myself continue to
train rigorously each day...

04:31.371 --> 04:34.966
...yet, I hear reports of some of my
retainers living in utter complacency...

04:35.075 --> 04:36.337
...as far as their
swordsmanship is concerned.

04:36.409 --> 04:38.809
I feel it's high time
I set them straight...

04:39.079 --> 04:44.073
I'm certain that some of the
matches will go down in history...

04:44.351 --> 04:47.548
Especially since it seems
that we will be getting a...

04:47.654 --> 04:49.952
...first-hand look at
the Yagyu Katsujin-Ken!

04:50.123 --> 04:51.385
Well, well! That's right!

04:51.925 --> 04:54.189
The Yagyu Sword is the Sword of
Kings...

04:54.427 --> 04:56.952
It is not, by any means,
a sword for killing others...

04:57.063 --> 04:59.964
...but precisely because of that, the
swordplay should be extraordinary!

05:00.100 --> 05:00.930
Am I right, Tajima?

05:01.234 --> 05:02.166
Yes, my lord.

05:04.004 --> 05:07.371
I am certain that the
Yagyu Clan shall prevail...

05:07.540 --> 05:08.939
Do you agree with that, Izu?

05:09.042 --> 05:13.240
Yes, my lord, since I am aware of
Lord Yagyu's sayings and doings...

05:13.346 --> 05:14.142
I do agree.

05:14.280 --> 05:17.249
Though my son Jubei's
skills are hardly up to par...

05:17.350 --> 05:19.648
...I am honored to submit the
Yagyu sword for your appraisal.

05:20.487 --> 05:22.455
Yours is a sword for political gain!

05:22.622 --> 05:24.613
Let that monstrous mask
of yours be ripped away!

05:25.358 --> 05:27.485
You damned stripling of a schemer...

05:27.627 --> 05:30.095
You and Tenkai can both go to hell!

05:31.197 --> 05:32.630
Wait, I almost forgot.

05:32.899 --> 05:34.833
As much as I'm looking
forward to seeing Jubei...

05:35.068 --> 05:39.562
Izu, I am also looking forward to seeing
the Mutsu person you mentioned.

05:41.341 --> 05:44.708
I understand that Jubei himself
has also recommended someone...

05:44.811 --> 05:47.609
Yes, my lord. A man named Takato.

05:47.714 --> 05:49.682
As he comes so highly
recommended by my son...

05:49.783 --> 05:52.581
...I intend to allot him a berth
to compete in the tournament.

05:52.685 --> 05:55.210
What's his Style? And
what's his surname?

05:55.422 --> 05:56.719
Actually...

05:56.823 --> 05:57.915
You don't know?

05:58.024 --> 06:00.686
That is correct. His background
is known only to Jubei...

06:01.161 --> 06:04.653
Is he truly a swordsman of sufficient
caliber to appear before ME?

06:04.898 --> 06:08.129
I trust Jubei's judgment, my lord.

06:11.504 --> 06:14.735
All right, then! We'll test
the skills of this Takato!

06:14.874 --> 06:16.842
Yes, that's a good idea!

06:16.943 --> 06:19.104
As for his opponent, I
shall select him myself.

06:19.312 --> 06:20.074
Yes, my lord.

06:20.180 --> 06:24.048
There is a master of the spear
by the name of Matabei Takada...

06:24.150 --> 06:25.913
...at the Ogasawara residence.

06:26.019 --> 06:29.079
If I recall, he has
withdrawn from the tournament.

06:29.656 --> 06:30.315
Yes, my lord.

06:30.423 --> 06:33.221
He has declined on the grounds
that the Ogasawara Clan...

06:33.393 --> 06:35.827
...has already sent Iori
Miyamoto to the tournament.

06:36.463 --> 06:39.921
Well, what about Matabei, then?
That's something I'd like to see!

06:40.100 --> 06:43.797
Matabei Takada is the best
spearmaster in the country.

06:43.870 --> 06:45.963
If this Takato person
were to lose to him...

06:46.106 --> 06:48.768
...then Jubei would most likely
withdraw from the tournament...

06:49.175 --> 06:50.472
What do you think, Tajima?

06:50.677 --> 06:52.508
Yes, my lord! As you wish.

07:24.410 --> 07:26.776
Lord Matabei Takada...

07:27.013 --> 07:28.378
Your technique is sublime!

07:29.349 --> 07:30.338
And you are?

07:30.950 --> 07:32.508
I beg your pardon...

07:32.685 --> 07:34.550
I am the second son of Munenori Yagyu.

07:34.687 --> 07:36.951
My name is Samon Tomonori Yagyu.

07:37.157 --> 07:40.320
I have come here to discuss the
Shogun's Tournament with you.

07:40.627 --> 07:44.290
As my weapon of choice is the spear,
the tournament is irrelevant to me.

07:44.531 --> 07:47.329
We are in need of those skills of yours.

07:47.467 --> 07:50.300
I am here at the behest
of the Shogun himself.

07:51.604 --> 07:52.935
The Shogun?

08:05.418 --> 08:06.146
Jii!

08:20.266 --> 08:22.359
If you want more, you
can go fetch it yourself!

08:22.468 --> 08:23.901
You're not getting any of this!

08:26.139 --> 08:27.936
So, how are you going to pull it off?

08:31.010 --> 08:35.071
Sure, the Shogun will be there, but
you won't be within striking distance.

08:37.417 --> 08:40.147
And security around Iemitsu
is bound to be extra tight.

08:40.587 --> 08:44.318
Last but not least, the
contestants are all elite swordsmen...

08:44.591 --> 08:48.550
If you act the least bit fishy, you'll
end up having to take them all on.

08:49.662 --> 08:51.823
It's a tournament, so I'll win it all!

08:51.931 --> 08:54.456
I'll win, and Iemitsu will
call me over to congratulate me...

08:54.567 --> 08:56.262
...that's when I'll slay him!

09:01.574 --> 09:02.506
And then...

09:02.642 --> 09:05.839
I'll hold up his head and I'm going
to laugh... right in Tenkai's face!

09:06.045 --> 09:09.742
At the greedy old geezer-monk who
dug his own grave with his schemes!

09:10.183 --> 09:12.981
Well, if that happens,
both Tenkai and Munenori...

09:13.086 --> 09:15.213
...will realize how
foolish they were, but...

09:15.788 --> 09:16.447
Hey!

09:18.558 --> 09:21.425
Don't do it. You don't have
a chance against that Jubei.

09:21.995 --> 09:24.054
Don't underestimate
me because I'm a woman.

09:24.631 --> 09:28.533
I'm not saying you're weak. It's
just that Jubei's way too powerful.

09:32.472 --> 09:37.774
On the other hand, you just might
be able to defeat Iori Miyamoto.

09:37.910 --> 09:40.378
Skill-wise, he can probably
hold his own against Jubei...

09:40.513 --> 09:42.538
...but unlike Musashi, he
doesn't have the killer instinct.

09:42.682 --> 09:45.344
Whereas Jubei, no matter how
extraordinary a ninja you may be...

09:45.451 --> 09:47.214
...you won't be able to
sneak up behind that guy.

09:47.420 --> 09:48.580
Quite true...

09:49.689 --> 09:50.883
That time...

09:51.024 --> 09:55.484
I was able to get behind Lord
Iori by concealing my ninja skills...

09:56.062 --> 09:58.622
But against Lord Jubei,
there'd be no chance.

10:00.600 --> 10:03.091
Iori Miyamoto has too soft a heart...

10:03.236 --> 10:06.865
Most likely he'd choke in
a match against a woman.

10:09.275 --> 10:11.573
But that's not going
to happen with Jubei.

10:11.711 --> 10:15.841
He'll go for the jugular all the
more because you're an able fighter!

10:15.982 --> 10:18.746
I'll never know if I can
beat him or not unless I try!

10:19.552 --> 10:22.783
You've just said that the Young
Miss can't defeat this Jubei...

10:22.922 --> 10:25.356
...but what about
yourself, Lord Takato?

10:26.492 --> 10:28.892
I know that you have been
challenged by Lord Jubei.

10:29.028 --> 10:30.620
That he'll be waiting for
you at the tournament...

10:30.763 --> 10:31.787
Is that true, Sasuke?

10:33.566 --> 10:36.729
All too true, so I'm
asking you now to compete.

10:37.403 --> 10:39.963
Challenged by that Jubei?

10:40.440 --> 10:42.704
Who the hell is this guy?

10:43.376 --> 10:44.775
I beg of you, sir!

10:44.911 --> 10:47.175
Did you not call yourself our ally?

10:47.280 --> 10:49.510
Actually, even if I
didn't implore you to...

10:49.615 --> 10:51.913
...I'm sure that deep down
inside, you're itching to try.

10:52.819 --> 10:54.616
Damn you, old man!

10:59.258 --> 11:02.557
There's no guarantee that
I'll draw Jubei before you do.

11:04.831 --> 11:05.889
Jii!

11:07.100 --> 11:09.432
It looks like I'm in the
same boat as you now...

11:09.635 --> 11:12.604
Going down a river awash with so many
different yearnings and passions...

11:12.739 --> 11:15.003
...a river called the Shogun's
Tournament.

11:15.541 --> 11:17.270
There's a waterfall ahead.

11:17.377 --> 11:21.746
One of us will survive the fall over that
roaring cascade and laugh in the end...

11:22.181 --> 11:23.978
I wonder who it will be?

11:28.287 --> 11:30.414
Tell me who the hell you are!

11:31.991 --> 11:33.390
I'm on your side, remember?

11:33.993 --> 11:35.722
Why are you taking our side?

11:35.862 --> 11:38.353
And don't you dare tell me it's
because Sasuke asked you to!

11:41.834 --> 11:44.530
Because it was love at first sight.

11:44.937 --> 11:46.165
What the hell?

11:48.875 --> 11:49.773
Just kidding!

11:51.744 --> 11:53.939
Actually, it was your
name that did it for me.

11:54.046 --> 11:55.377
Tsubura Mutsu!

11:56.048 --> 11:56.742
Damn you!

11:56.849 --> 11:58.908
Why don't you go get
yourself killed by Jubei?

11:59.018 --> 12:01.282
No, why don't you just die now, idiot!

12:01.654 --> 12:02.985
Hey, hey, that's dangerous!

12:21.874 --> 12:23.637
Now then, Lady Mutsu.

12:23.810 --> 12:26.973
Please bear in mind the
agreement you have with my lord.

12:27.480 --> 12:28.344
Right.

12:30.183 --> 12:33.175
Well, here we are.

12:36.823 --> 12:38.552
This is the waterfall!

13:37.149 --> 13:39.014
Please wait here.

13:53.633 --> 13:55.658
Hey, what the hell?

13:55.835 --> 13:57.234
That's a woman over there...

13:57.370 --> 14:00.100
That would be the Mutsu Enmei Style.

14:00.206 --> 14:01.298
You mean she's...

14:01.941 --> 14:04.705
The legendary Mutsu, at whose
hands Lord Iori's master...

14:04.911 --> 14:07.277
...Musashi Miyamoto,
suffered his only defeat?

14:08.381 --> 14:10.246
Except it's not just a legend.

14:14.186 --> 14:15.619
Master!

14:20.426 --> 14:23.418
That duel was fought before my own
eyes.

14:23.563 --> 14:24.291
Really?

14:24.397 --> 14:28.356
The man who duelled my master
did declare the match a draw...

14:29.402 --> 14:33.065
Whether or not that woman is truly
a member of the legendary Mutsu clan...

14:33.205 --> 14:34.536
...I cannot say.

14:38.477 --> 14:39.501
Iori Miyamoto!

14:39.912 --> 14:43.143
It never occurred to me that
your reason for challenging me...

14:43.249 --> 14:45.114
...was to compete in this tournament!

14:46.452 --> 14:48.920
Come, there's no need
to scowl at me like that...

14:49.355 --> 14:51.346
Lady Tsubura Mutsu!

14:52.158 --> 14:53.147
And you are...

14:53.292 --> 14:56.819
Listen, don't get my name wrong again.

14:57.496 --> 14:59.862
My name isn't Jubei, you know!

15:00.366 --> 15:01.162
Wait...

15:01.634 --> 15:04.831
I thought the Yagyu heir was one-eyed...

15:05.137 --> 15:07.697
The real Jubei is right behind you!

15:08.908 --> 15:11.502
What? What is this overwhelming Ki?

15:11.611 --> 15:12.873
I could swear it's...

15:13.045 --> 15:14.512
Lord Musashi!

15:25.925 --> 15:27.950
So this is Jubei...

15:31.330 --> 15:32.888
I see you kept your promise.

15:33.666 --> 15:35.861
I don't remember promising you
anything!

15:37.003 --> 15:39.062
And you would be...

15:39.905 --> 15:44.171
...Iori Miyamoto, whose skills
Musashi said were as yet unpolished?

15:44.276 --> 15:45.072
That would be me.

15:45.711 --> 15:47.042
And...

15:47.546 --> 15:50.106
...you are the legendary
Mutsu, are you not?

15:50.316 --> 15:52.011
Disappointed that I'm a girl?

16:01.627 --> 16:05.495
I, Jubei, would like nothing
more than to draw each and every...

16:05.631 --> 16:07.599
...one of you in these matches!

16:20.179 --> 16:24.377
Sir, are you Lord Takato, the
man recommended by Jubei Yagyu?

16:24.517 --> 16:25.176
Yes...

16:25.551 --> 16:28.748
My name is Samon Tomonori Yagyu.

16:28.888 --> 16:29.513
Right.

16:29.922 --> 16:33.790
My brother Jubei has recommended
you for this tournament...

16:33.926 --> 16:37.191
...but as you have neither
a surname nor a style...

16:37.296 --> 16:39.628
...the Shogun has imposed one
condition.

16:40.566 --> 16:43.899
To determine whether your skills
are of the caliber to compete here...

16:44.036 --> 16:46.368
...the Shogun has ordered
those skills to be tested.

16:46.505 --> 16:47.995
Man, what a pain in the butt...

16:48.207 --> 16:50.641
I never said I was
going to compete, either...

16:51.277 --> 16:53.370
I presume you have no objections?

16:55.715 --> 16:58.343
Nope, since it doesn't look
like I have a choice either way.

17:04.223 --> 17:05.781
Lord Matabei Takada...

17:06.292 --> 17:07.316
Lord Takato...

17:07.927 --> 17:09.121
You're being summoned.

17:09.261 --> 17:10.285
Sounds like it.

17:10.629 --> 17:13.996
Lord Takato, real swords are not
used in the Shogun's Tournament.

17:14.100 --> 17:16.534
I hope this meets with your approval?

17:21.173 --> 17:22.401
Well, it'll do.

17:22.508 --> 17:23.634
Hang on to this for me?

17:23.743 --> 17:24.732
Yes, sir.

17:30.516 --> 17:32.108
What kind of a spear is that?

17:32.218 --> 17:35.676
It is called the Hozoin
Style cross-spear.

17:35.888 --> 17:38.322
A spear when one thrusts,
a halberd when one strikes...

17:38.457 --> 17:39.651
...and a sickle when one swings.

17:40.092 --> 17:43.391
It is a weapon celebrated
for its versatility.

17:47.233 --> 17:51.670
Ordinarily, a long spear gives its user
a 70 percent advantage over a sword.

17:52.571 --> 17:55.267
They say that even the
great Musashi Miyamoto...

17:55.374 --> 17:59.174
...struggled mightily against
Hozoin Style spearmasters.

18:00.246 --> 18:02.714
So losing the match is
the least of his worries...

18:03.082 --> 18:05.050
I have dulled the blade for this match...

18:05.184 --> 18:08.347
...but one blow in the wrong
place, and you could still die.

18:08.487 --> 18:09.681
Do you want to
go through with this?

18:10.256 --> 18:11.154
Sure.

18:12.591 --> 18:16.584
This match is a qualifying
round for the Shogun's Tournament.

18:16.762 --> 18:18.753
Should Lord Takato win,
he shall be granted...

18:18.864 --> 18:21.025
...the right to compete
in the tournament.

18:21.167 --> 18:22.225
Understood?

18:22.434 --> 18:23.128
Right.

18:23.435 --> 18:27.098
Why didn't Father mention
this qualifying match to me?

18:27.606 --> 18:29.130
Because he was afraid...

18:29.241 --> 18:32.267
...I would withdraw from the
tournament if that man lost?

18:33.579 --> 18:36.070
And yet such worries are unnecessary!

18:36.615 --> 18:38.742
So now we can see for ourselves...

18:38.851 --> 18:42.048
...how true your son's judgment was in
vouching for that mongrel of a fighter.

18:42.354 --> 18:44.185
I am certain you shall!

18:45.191 --> 18:50.026
So long as Jubei competes here, I don't
give a damn what happens to this man.

18:52.198 --> 18:54.496
Truly, I can hardly wait.

18:55.868 --> 18:56.459
Begin!

19:10.749 --> 19:11.681
His stance...

19:12.818 --> 19:16.652
He appears to be leaving himself
wide open, but I can tell...

19:18.691 --> 19:19.623
...he's powerful!

19:34.139 --> 19:37.631
Matabei Takada's spear
is truly a protean weapon!

19:37.776 --> 19:40.540
His opponent narrowly
escaped a death blow just now!

19:45.451 --> 19:47.442
Why the hell is he
fooling around like that?

19:47.820 --> 19:50.186
Come on, Takato or whoever...

19:50.322 --> 19:53.018
Show me just a glimpse
of your formidable power!

19:56.228 --> 19:59.026
This time I'm going to use the
Hozoin Style spear technique.

19:59.331 --> 20:02.960
I trust you won't have any regrets
should you be killed on the spot?

20:06.472 --> 20:08.940
Why don't you just bring it on?

20:25.124 --> 20:26.557
His agility is superb.

20:26.692 --> 20:28.660
I knew he'd put up a good fight...

20:30.963 --> 20:32.726
You're just like me...

20:32.865 --> 20:35.629
...an idiot who seeks
only a worthy opponent!

20:38.771 --> 20:42.605
All you've done is dodge. Is that
thing you're holding just for show?

20:44.443 --> 20:45.410
Probably.

20:53.886 --> 20:54.511
Huh?

20:57.790 --> 20:59.018
Enough!

21:05.331 --> 21:07.231
Winner... Lord Takato!

21:07.333 --> 21:10.734
With this win, Lord Takato's right to
compete in the elimination...

21:11.270 --> 21:13.704
...tournament has been
officially approved.

21:19.244 --> 21:25.274
<i>To be continued...</i>

21:38.297 --> 21:50.334
<i>Those summer stars, I looked up at</i>
<i>them alone when I was a troubled child.</i>

21:50.609 --> 22:00.348
<i>My loneliness and the vast night</i>
<i>sky, melting and shining in eternity.</i>

22:00.486 --> 22:09.485
<i>I just don't know what this</i>
<i>dream means, if it leads to love...</i>

22:09.628 --> 22:20.300
<i>Even if it's just "hello,"</i>
<i>I want to hear your voice.</i>

22:21.340 --> 22:27.472
<i>The person I am today</i>
<i>is about to disappear...</i>

22:27.846 --> 22:30.838
<i>What is it that will hold me back?</i>

22:31.650 --> 22:37.987
<i>Will it be you? I won't ask you now.</i>

22:38.290 --> 22:43.785
<i>Maybe if we ever meet again...</i>

22:58.544 --> 23:00.603
The Shogun's Tournament has begun.

23:00.879 --> 23:05.373
The battleground is a whirlpool of the
desires and passions of all involved.

23:06.085 --> 23:07.643
Next episode of the Age of Chaos...

23:07.986 --> 23:09.715
"The Shogun's Tournament."

23:09.855 --> 23:11.755
Pay close attention, and wait!
